  "title": "Vertiv Announces Date of Second Quarter 2022 Earnings Release and Conference Call",
  "summary": "Vertiv today announced it will report its second quarter 2022 results before market open on Wednesday, August 3, 2022. The press release will contain a link to the presentation materials providing a second quarter 2022 update, which will be available on Vertiv’s website at investors.vertiv.com. Vertiv’s management team will discuss the results during a conference call the same day, starting at 11 a.m. Eastern Time.",
